  "bio": "DJ Minor is a standout tattoo artist based in Chattanooga, known for their exceptional skills in the 'newschool' and 'illustrative' tattoo genres. With a keen eye for detail and a mastery of vibrant colors, DJ brings each client's vision to life with precision and creativity. Their professionalism is reflected not only in the stunning artwork they produce but also in the immaculate cleanliness of their work environment, ensuring a safe and welcoming experience for all clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Chattanooga, Tennessee, United States\n\nI use this page to look at videos of puppy’s and potatoes. Go follow my new tattoo page @djminor.tattoo \n📍Pensacola @fatestattoo",
